+// Waveshare ESP32-S3-ePaper-1.54 V2 (ESP32-S3, 8 MB flash, 8 MB octal PSRAM).
+//
+// Panel: 1.54" 200x200 B/W behind an SSD1681. The panel supply is an AO3401
